tml":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定有效 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(Q,\\Sigma,K,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)\">\\(A=(Q,\\Sigma,K,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"86f675ae3180238d\" href=\"?note=86f675ae3180238d\" title=\"73-df-stack-automaton\">73-df-stack-automaton</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_A=Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\})\\times K\\times\\mathbf2\">\\(\\mathcal D_A=Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\})\\times K\\times\\mathbf2\\)</span> 为转移输入域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton\\text{-}variants}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DSA}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathcal D_A\\;|\\delta(x)|\\le1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton\\text{-}variants}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DSA}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathcal D_A\\;|\\delta(x)|\\le1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton\\text{-}variants}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NESA}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathcal D_A\\;\\forall(p,d,\\alpha)\\in\\delta(x)\\;\\alpha\\ne(2,\\varepsilon)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton\\text{-}variants}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NESA}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathcal D_A\\;\\forall(p,d,\\alpha)\\in\\delta(x)\\;\\alpha\\ne(2,\\varepsilon)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton\\text{-}variants}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OneWaySA}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathcal D_A\\;\\forall(p,d,\\alpha)\\in\\delta(x)\\;d\\ge0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton\\text{-}variants}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OneWaySA}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathcal D_A\\;\\forall(p,d,\\alpha)\\in\\delta(x)\\;d\\ge0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton\\text{-}variants}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NESLang}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L(A):A\\in\\{B:\\operatorname{SA}_{\\Sigma}(B)\\}\\land\\operatorname{NESA}(A)\\},\\quad\\mathsf{NEDSLang}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L(A):A\\in\\{B:\\operatorname{SA}_{\\Sigma}(B)\\}\\land\\operatorname{NESA}(A)\\land\\operatorname{DSA}(A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stack\\text{-}automaton\\text{-}variants}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NESLang}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L(A):A\\in\\{B:\\operatorname{SA}_{\\Sigma}(B)\\}\\land\\operatorname{NESA}(A)\\},\\quad\\mathsf{NEDSLang}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L(A):A\\in\\{B:\\operatorname{SA}_{\\Sigma}(B)\\}\\land\\operatorname{NESA}(A)\\land\\operatorname{DSA}(A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>非擦除指没有弹栈动作，不限制在内部来回读；单向只限制输入头，不限制栈头方向。NSA 是一般有限分支模型，DSA 是其中单值模型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-stack-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"86f675a