-automaton-variants]]；CFL 泵引理见 [[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-350","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-stack-automaton-variants|确定性、非擦除与单向栈自动机]]"},{"id":"fd88374f7188fc4c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"输入字母表固定为 $\\mathbf2$。非擦除栈语言类见 [[73-df-stack-automaton-variants]]；工作空间类见 [[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]、[[73-df-nondeterministic-work-space]]。$n\\in\\mathbb N$。"}],"outgoing":["86f675ae3180238d"]}